 {
  "at": 2.1,
  "text": "What this does not say:"
 },
 {
  "at": 2.1,
  "text": "  - One run per contender. Agents are stochastic; a difference within noise is"
 },
 {
  "at": 2.1,
  "text": "    noise."
 },
 {
  "at": 2.1,
  "text": "  - Usage and cost are the agent's own report, unverified. Absent means"
 },
 {
  "at": 2.1,
  "text": "    unreported, never zero."
 },
 {
  "at": 2.1,
  "text": "  - A green gate proves the gates went green, not that the fix is honest \u2014"
 },
 {
